WEBVTT

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:07.540
We were about to set upon the path.

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.590
The path to happiness...

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:11.170
The path to the future...

00:00:11.170 --> 00:00:13.990
A path that had never been open to us before.

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:18.540
With someone beside me...

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:24.840
We were going to walk this path together.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:07.190
<b>Tenth Hour: Kohinata</b>

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:14.880
You made this?

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:17.980
Well, you are letting me stay here.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:19.420
So I thought it'd be a "thank you."

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:24.250
But actually, it's the cooking
of a newlywed wife,

00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:27.300
filled with love! You lucky boy!

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:29.810
That hurts, Uncle!

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:30.900
No!

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:36.000
I never thought my nephew would
get there before me...

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:39.220
Just you look at this delicious karaage.

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:45.140
So good!

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:48.450
This is the taste of love...

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:51.480
Did we have any meat?

00:02:51.480 --> 00:02:55.000
I got up earlier and went
to the fields, to get some.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:56.290
The fields?

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:20.300
Good morning!

00:03:20.300 --> 00:03:21.540
Morning, Hotaru-chan.

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:22.110
Morning!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.040
What?

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:28.620
Nothing, nothing.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:29.670
What?

00:03:29.670 --> 00:03:30.950
Nothing.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:33.220
What? What? What?

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:36.230
Congratulations!

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.230
<b>Takuma</b>

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:36.230
<b>Hayami</b>

00:03:36.230 --> 00:03:37.540
Yay!

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:40.330
Hey, you two!

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.000
Wh-What is this?

00:03:44.840 --> 00:03:47.540
That's the bell everyone's
talking about, right?

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:53.530
So what were your words of love,
when you gave her the bell?

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:55.760
And what about you, Kohinata-san?

00:03:55.760 --> 00:03:58.510
How long have you been after Hirose-kun?

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:00.250
D-Don't be stupid!

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:01.500
H-Hamaji-chan?

00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:02.150
Maki-chan?

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:04.680
We won't let you two be
the only happy ones.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.680
That's right!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:12.160
Hirose-kun, especially, has a duty to talk to us.

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.830
Wh-Why?

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.530
Look at that!

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:19.570
She was at the festival grounds until morning,

00:04:19.570 --> 00:04:22.980
waiting for a certain someone
to give her a bell.

00:04:22.980 --> 00:04:25.540
A certain someone? Who's that?

00:04:25.540 --> 00:04:26.710
It's fine.

00:04:26.710 --> 00:04:28.230
Just fine!

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:31.410
The fields won't hurt me...

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:34.490
The grain won't betray me!

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:38.490
I shall live and be one with the farm!

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:42.760
So Hirose-kun, for Yui-chan's sake, as well,

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:44.540
you need to tell us everything.

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:45.660
That's right.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:47.430
I don't understand!

00:04:47.430 --> 00:04:50.300
How did it go down?

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:54.670
Don't be embarrassed. Cough up the details!

00:04:55.500 --> 00:04:59.060
Why didn't you give the bell to me, Hirose?

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:07.280
So, how's the newlywed life?

00:05:07.280 --> 00:05:09.850
It's not like that...

00:05:09.850 --> 00:05:11.160
Yui-chan?

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:13.190
You alive?

00:05:13.190 --> 00:05:15.830
He said he wanted me by his side.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:20.260
And I said I wanted to stay by his.

00:05:22.810 --> 00:05:25.180
J-Just because I took the bell,
it doesn't mean

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:26.740
I-I'm gonna marry him!

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:28.750
I know.

00:05:28.750 --> 00:05:31.010
But I'm glad the two of you are going well.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.670
I don't know if we're going well.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:40.380
But I'll make Hirose happy.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:42.890
He seems happy enough already.

00:05:49.260 --> 00:05:53.900
The Hirose boy gave a bell to the Kohinata girl!

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:58.310
She's trying to get close to Hirose,
to take revenge on us!

00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:00.370
What do we do, Chief?

00:06:00.370 --> 00:06:03.470
There's no need to worry.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:06.540
Those two will never be together.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:11.850
It's impossible for them to be together.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:16.620
A job? On a day off?

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:19.420
It's good to be busy.

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.290
Have fun, you guys!

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:22.870
Bye!

00:06:22.870 --> 00:06:24.310
Take care!

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:31.000
Well, as an adult, I should
give them some time alone...

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:34.540
So, where to go?

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.490
We're all alone, yeah?

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:39.980
Y-Yeah.

00:06:55.420 --> 00:06:56.960
What are you doing?

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:02.010
Don't worry. I'll do it.

00:07:19.490 --> 00:07:20.960
What's wrong?

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:26.090
Don't worry. I'll do it.

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:36.570
I-I'll do the washing later, so get out of here!

00:07:50.920 --> 00:07:54.220
At least I'm as good at cooking as you are.

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.020
No frogs in it, right?

00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:00.120
And then, fried egg for last.

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:05.780
I-It's not the Japanese yams I like.

00:08:05.780 --> 00:08:10.300
It's your favorite. Without much sugar...

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.640
I heard from Hotaru...

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:15.570
Great!

00:08:15.570 --> 00:08:20.140
You may not like them.
So if you don't, tell me, okay?

00:08:20.140 --> 00:08:22.720
I'll make them better next time.

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:24.320
These are great!

00:08:24.890 --> 00:08:26.080
They're great!

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:31.300
Some tea.

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:32.390
Thanks!

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:45.560
When I was a kid, I don't know why,

00:08:45.560 --> 00:08:49.010
but there was a time when things were really
dark and grim around my house.

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:51.240
My dad was always tired...

00:08:56.410 --> 00:09:01.230
But my mom was always cheerful and gentle.

00:09:03.320 --> 00:09:04.860
We didn't have any money,

00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:07.460
and we couldn't go far for vacations and stuff.

00:09:08.220 --> 00:09:10.580
But sometimes, my mom would take me

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:11.900
to the neighborhood park.

00:09:11.900 --> 00:09:14.630
It was a tiny, normal little park.

00:09:16.070 --> 00:09:18.470
We'd eat lunch there.

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:21.870
A meal only consisting of onigiri and fried egg.

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:24.740
But it really was delicious!

00:09:26.270 --> 00:09:29.190
It was really good.

00:09:31.640 --> 00:09:33.880
Yours are good, too!

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:36.040
I'll make them again.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:37.810
Again and again...

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:40.660
I'll make you lots!

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:36.920
Holding hands...

00:10:36.920 --> 00:10:38.520
How nice.

00:10:41.220 --> 00:10:43.360
Wh-What do you want?

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:48.690
Takuma-kun, I've been told that
you gave that girl a bell.

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:52.330
Is that really something
you should be doing?

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.900
This village has nothing to do with it.

00:10:54.900 --> 00:10:58.840
No matter what Hayami-chan's family
once did, it has nothing to do with...

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:03.610
It seems you really do know nothing.

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:07.040
About what?

00:11:07.040 --> 00:11:15.050
About how the Kohinata family
killed your mother.

00:11:16.720 --> 00:11:19.600
It was Kohinata Hayami's family

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:26.700
that made her suffer until she killed herself.

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:39.010
Ta-dah!

00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:42.950
The photos from our trip to the sea are ready!

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:46.890
Maki, you look funny.

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.450
Shut up!

00:11:48.450 --> 00:11:51.050
Yui-san, you look great here.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:55.770
Hirose-sama, you look good in these, too.

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:58.430
Yeah, I look like I'm having a great time!

00:11:59.120 --> 00:12:01.670
Hey, Hotaru-chan?

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:03.900
Wh-What is it?

00:12:03.900 --> 00:12:07.320
Want to go somewhere for summer break?

00:12:07.320 --> 00:12:08.650
That's a great idea!

00:12:08.650 --> 00:12:09.810
The sea again?

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:11.580
Or the mountains?

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:14.030
But I want to wear my school swimsuit again!

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:17.780
That's right!

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:18.920
Yui-chan?

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:22.040
Summer is the season of adventure!

00:12:22.040 --> 00:12:26.160
I'll find a rich and gorgeous man,
who's a suitable match for me!

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:29.710
Yui-chan's back.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:34.280
Adventure! Adventure!

00:12:35.590 --> 00:12:38.900
Uncle, about my mom...

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:44.640
Yeah...

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:45.510
It's true.

00:12:47.010 --> 00:12:54.300
Your mother was promised in
marriage to a Kohinata family man.

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:58.730
But then she met your father...
My older brother.

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:02.610
They eloped.

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:08.000
By the time they were found...
You were already around.

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:12.960
The Hirose family accepted
their marriage. They had no choice.

00:13:12.960 --> 00:13:15.330
But the Kohinata family couldn't let it go,

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:17.310
and they made life worse and worse.

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:21.740
Your mother couldn't take it, and she...

00:13:24.280 --> 00:13:25.820
Hayami-chan?

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.850
What's wrong?

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:29.550
You look sad.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.760
A lover's quarrel already?

00:13:33.770 --> 00:13:35.090
N-No...

00:13:36.590 --> 00:13:40.290
This summer, I shall become happy!

00:13:40.290 --> 00:13:41.440
Yeah, yeah.

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:45.070
A girl becomes more beautiful,
every time she's unlucky in love!

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:47.660
Become even more beautiful,
and you'll show him!

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:49.870
Um...

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:52.490
What are we talking about?

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:55.580
I'll find him!

00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:57.860
That's right! That's right!

00:13:57.860 --> 00:13:59.090
Do your best, Yui-chan!

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:01.120
What's wrong, Hirose-kun?

00:14:02.730 --> 00:14:04.290
N-Nothing...

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:15.470
So we were saying we'd go camping
over the summer break.

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:17.390
Fish in the river,

00:14:17.390 --> 00:14:18.860
and put up tents!

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:21.950
Uncle, you were great at barbecues, right?

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:23.660
Show me how to do it.

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:25.410
S-Sure...

00:14:25.410 --> 00:14:28.260
In the fall, we're gonna go mountain climbing.

00:14:28.260 --> 00:14:29.500
Skiing in winter...

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:32.530
Actually, I've never gone skiing.

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:34.180
Have you, Uncle?

00:14:37.140 --> 00:14:40.000
Is this really okay?

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.690
Is what?

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:45.060
Can we really be together?

00:14:45.060 --> 00:14:50.800
Because of family... The Kohinata family...

00:14:53.120 --> 00:14:54.640
It has nothing to do with anything.

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:58.420
But if you're forcing yourself...

00:14:58.420 --> 00:15:00.810
If it's bothering you...

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:03.250
I understand.

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:05.120
Hayami-chan.

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:12.370
No matter what happens,
I can't return to the way I was.

00:15:18.680 --> 00:15:20.060
So...

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.430
I said it's got nothing to do with anything!

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:28.740
I'm sorry.

00:15:28.740 --> 00:15:29.840
No...

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:32.780
Let's stop talking about this.

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.710
Yeah.

00:15:37.750 --> 00:15:39.700
I'm tired.

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:41.920
Then, I'll be going.

00:15:41.920 --> 00:15:43.290
Yeah, night.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:45.520
Goodnight.

00:16:15.140 --> 00:16:17.390
Grandfather...

00:16:17.390 --> 00:16:21.070
Did you do something to Hirose-sama
and Hayami-chan again?

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:40.530
A typhoon's getting close,
so school's canceled for the day...

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:42.670
They announced it a while ago.

00:16:42.670 --> 00:16:45.730
I wish they would have told us
before we changed.

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:48.840
Uncle left early this morning.

00:16:48.840 --> 00:16:51.090
He said there was a lot he
needed to get ready...

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:53.060
Oh.

00:16:54.990 --> 00:16:57.760
Then, we can relax all day.

00:16:58.670 --> 00:16:59.850
Yeah...

00:17:51.240 --> 00:17:52.750
Mom?

00:17:58.960 --> 00:18:00.120
Mom?

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:01.610
Wait!

00:18:01.610 --> 00:18:03.860
Don't leave me!

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:08.260
Mom! Mom!

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:12.070
Mom!

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:19.310
H-Hayami-chan...

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:30.290
No!

00:18:36.690 --> 00:18:39.130
Don't!

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:55.170
N-No...

00:18:55.170 --> 00:18:56.380
Um...

00:18:56.380 --> 00:18:58.370
I was dreaming...

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:02.640
I see.

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:09.190
I'm sorry.

00:19:11.020 --> 00:19:12.260
What?

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:15.570
What do you mean, "I'm sorry"?

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:17.700
What do you mean, "I'm sorry"?!

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:22.310
Because your family killed my mother?

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:25.520
So you can't stay with me?

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:26.510
H-Hirose...

00:19:26.510 --> 00:19:28.180
What of it?

00:19:28.180 --> 00:19:30.150
So you apologize!

00:19:30.150 --> 00:19:32.750
So you leave!

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:34.380
My mom...

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:38.490
My mom isn't coming back!

00:19:54.470 --> 00:19:56.390
Hayami-chan...

00:21:35.470 --> 00:21:36.650
What are you doing?

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:38.240
Stop it!

00:21:38.240 --> 00:21:41.230
The river might overflow!

00:21:42.010 --> 00:21:43.110
Shut up!

00:21:43.110 --> 00:21:44.660
Why, you...

00:21:44.660 --> 00:21:48.410
Our dads were saying you were
going to destroy the village!

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:50.950
You are... You really are!

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.190
That's right.

00:21:53.190 --> 00:21:55.830
I'm going to destroy everything!

00:21:57.760 --> 00:22:00.200
You tricked everyone!

00:22:00.200 --> 00:22:02.600
We won't let you ruin the village!

00:24:00.020 --> 00:24:02.490
Everything I've seen...

00:24:02.490 --> 00:24:04.990
Everyone I've met...

00:24:04.990 --> 00:24:07.560
All the lies I've believed...

00:24:07.560 --> 00:24:10.920
All the selves I've fought...

00:24:11.410 --> 00:24:14.860
<b>Eleventh Hour: Hirose</b>

00:24:11.690 --> 00:24:14.830
It's all inside that darkness.
